 ## Overview
-The Gaussian Splat PLY Loader parses 3D Gaussian parameters (position, scale, rotation, color, opacity, and spherical harmonics) from a PLY file into a structured data container [S1, unofficial]. It converts raw file data into a format suitable for differentiable rendering by applying necessary inverse transformations (exponentiation for scale, sigmoid for opacity) and packing data for GPU consumption [S1, unofficial]. It differs from sibling loaders by specifically handling the `gsplat`-style PLY format which stores scales and opacities in latent space, requiring explicit decoding during load [S1, unofficial].
