 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$, where $N$ is the number of Gaussians. Linear pass for decoding and packing [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$. Stores raw vectors plus a packed buffer of $8 \times N$ uint32s [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Performance:** Fast CPU-side loading. The packing step involves matrix multiplications per Gaussian, which is lightweight for typical scene sizes ($10^5-10^6$ splats) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Strengths:** Handles latent space decoding (exp/sigmoid) automatically. Packs data efficiently for GPU shaders [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Limitations:** Requires specific PLY property names. Does not handle coordinate system conversion (handled by sibling) [S1, unofficial].
